Source: wlanpi-misc-firmware
Section: non-free-firmware/kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Josh Schmelzle <josh@joshschmelzle.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/WLAN-Pi/wlanpi-misc-firmware

Package: wlanpi-misc-firmware
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Replaces: firmware-mediatek
Conflicts: firmware-mediatek
Description: WLAN Pi - binary firmware for misc wireless cards
 Packaged by WLAN Pi team with latest updates from MediaTek and Qualcomm.
 .
 This package provides newer MediaTek and Qualcomm ath12k firmware
 and replaces firmware-mediatek when installed. It uses dpkg-divert
 to take precedence over firmware-misc-nonfree and firmware-atheros
 for overlapping files.
 .
 Contents:
  * MediaTek MT7961 (MT7921) firmware
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/WIFI_RAM_CODE_MT7961_1.bin)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/WIFI_MT7961_patch_mcu_1_2_hdr.bin)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/BT_RAM_CODE_MT7961_1_2_hdr.bin)
  * MediaTek MT7610U firmware
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/mt7610u.bin)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/mt7610e.bin)
  * MediaTek MT7612U firmware
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mt7662.bin)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mt7662_rom_patch.bin)
  * MediaTek MT7922 firmware
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/WIFI_RAM_CODE_MT7922_1.bin)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/WIFI_MT7922_patch_mcu_1_1_hdr.bin)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/BT_RAM_CODE_MT7922_1_1_hdr.bin)
  * MediaTek MT7925 firmware (WiFi 7)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/mt7925/WIFI_RAM_CODE_MT7925_1_1.bin)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/mt7925/WIFI_MT7925_PATCH_MCU_1_1_hdr.bin)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/mt7925/BT_RAM_CODE_MT7925_1_1_hdr.bin)
  * MediaTek MT7902 (WiFi 6E, mt7921 family) firmware
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/WIFI_RAM_CODE_MT7902_1.bin)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/WIFI_MT7902_patch_mcu_1_1_hdr.bin)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/BT_RAM_CODE_MT7902_1_1_hdr.bin)
  * MediaTek MT7961/MT7921 1a-variant firmware
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/WIFI_RAM_CODE_MT7961_1a.bin)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/WIFI_MT7961_patch_mcu_1a_2_hdr.bin)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/BT_RAM_CODE_MT7961_1a_2_hdr.bin)
  * MediaTek MT7927 firmware (WiFi 7)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/mt7927/WIFI_RAM_CODE_MT6639_2_1.bin)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/mt7927/WIFI_MT6639_PATCH_MCU_2_1_hdr.bin)
    (WiFi only; Bluetooth firmware not yet available upstream)
  * Qualcomm ath12k WCN7850/QCN7851 firmware (WiFi 7, e.g. QCNCM865
    module)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/ath12k/WCN7850/hw2.0/amss.bin)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/ath12k/WCN7850/hw2.0/board-2.bin)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/ath12k/WCN7850/hw2.0/m3.bin)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/ath12k/WCN7850/hw2.0/ncm865/amss.bin)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/ath12k/WCN7850/hw2.0/ncm865/m3.bin)
  * MediaTek MT76xx/MT7915/MT7916 and Ralink rt2x00 firmware absorbed
    from firmware-mediatek for full compatibility
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mediatek/mt7601u.bin, mt7615_cr4.bin,
    mt7615_n9.bin, mt7615_rom_patch.bin, mt7622_n9.bin,
    mt7622_rom_patch.bin, mt7622pr2h.bin, mt7650.bin, mt7650e.bin,
    mt7662.bin, mt7662_rom_patch.bin, mt7662u.bin,
    mt7662u_rom_patch.bin, mt7663_n9_rebb.bin, mt7663_n9_v3.bin,
    mt7663pr2h.bin, mt7663pr2h_rebb.bin, mt7668pr2h.bin,
    mt7915_eeprom.bin, mt7915_eeprom_dbdc.bin, mt7915_rom_patch.bin,
    mt7915_wa.bin, mt7915_wm.bin, mt7916_eeprom.bin,
    mt7916_rom_patch.bin, mt7916_wa.bin, mt7916_wm.bin)
    (/usr/lib/firmware/mt7601u.bin, mt7650.bin, rt2561.bin,
    rt2561s.bin, rt2661.bin, rt2860.bin, rt2870.bin, rt3071.bin,
    rt3290.bin, rt73.bin)
